                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is “Nintendo hard “ not that artificial hollow knight difficulty but that fair old school challenge. I can definitely see bits of gargoyles quest and ghosts and goblins and castlevania especially the more Arcady haunted castle. \n\nThe crt is effect and graphics kicks me right back to my childhood in the late 80s and early 90s \n\nIt also runs great on the steam deck despite saying unsupported. \n\nThe only thing you need to do is set native resolution and it works perfectly out of the box other wise. \n\nRecommended.\n\n",
